{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Sea is a spooky adventure story game where you pilot an old rusty soviet research submarine known as<i> P27</i>\u00a0in search of the missing research team from the ODISEA Group.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as Mr. Sidorov, a mechanic working for the secretive Soviet research group known as O.D.I.S.EA. You know little about the organization\u2014only that your job is to maintain personal, one-man submarines used by the primary research team to explore deep fissures in the sea floor, known as Fractures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After the detonation of the Tsar Bomba, a new Fracture\u2014designated Fracture 17\u2014opened in the nearby Kara Sea. Now, you've been called upon to pilot an old prototype submarine in search of the missing research team that vanished into Fracture 17 and lost all contact.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/bb33b5afb7d469a54e9bfc601a818379.poster.avif?t=1755371024\" width=640 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/bb33b5afb7d469a54e9bfc601a818379.webm?t=1755371024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/bb33b5afb7d469a54e9bfc601a818379.mp4?t=1755371024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive deep beneath the Earths surface in search of your missing research team. Uncover the secrets of what they were searching for, and why they vanished. &quot;Seek not, that which you do not wish to behold.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/afab356bbd9071ac78eedb719512de52.avif?t=1755371024\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire illumination flares for visibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy tracking beacons to aid navigation and avoid getting lost</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take photos of anything unusual or anomalous</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock at stations to resupply</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use sonar to see the unseen</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.poster.avif?t=1755371024\" width=758 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.webm?t=1755371024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/extras/6ef1cc1bb86849c243de050b8e0ac45a.mp4?t=1755371024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855020?t=1755371024","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/a32b9503dbd843ed3472c9b9565e2e4adcb9922b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755371024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/b24ca564f241632eee0b32c4ffcbb347e76d6ded/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755371024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855020/b24ca564f241632eee0b32c4ffcbb347e76d6ded/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755371024","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera C